# Backend runs on its own subdomain (backend.storygame.localhost, see
# configs/nginx/storygame.conf), so requests are cross-origin — CORS on the
# backend side allows the frontend's origin via
# STORY_GAME_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (see compose.yaml). See src/api/client.ts
# for how this is consumed.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://backend.storygame.localhost
